    "body": "Yep. This happened because I was trying to write out [NameChar](https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#NT-NameChar in full, by merging NameStartChar (which contains `[#xF8-#x2FF] | [#x370-#x37D]`) with the extra ranges added in NameChar (namely `[#x0300-#x036F]`). PR incoming.\n",
